    "method": "Qualla-first corpus search, then exact official explicitly public-domain agency/photographer originals and current model comparison.",
    "notes": "The exact Highsmith2005original confirms both full street elevations: five-storey red/tan brick corner mass, recessed rectangular middle windows, paired/banded upper openings, round-headed top-storey windows, deep patterned cornice, arched Broadway entry, long Third Street frontage and two exterior fire-escape stacks. Current corner, Broadway, Third Street and upper-cornice renders retain those identifying proportions and rhythms. Shops/signage are simplified and unbranded. Rooflight and hidden courtyard/rear walls follow the recorded mapped plan and remain approximate; fine terracotta carving, individual brick courses, interior ironwork and hidden roof services are outside this exterior scope.",
    "inputHash": "sha256:fc7ba98655ece42eea47a5838ffb892b7c4677eeb6616642643ef2e47be2b574"
